<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Georgia-Pacific upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it raised its rating on Georgia-Pacific Corp to buy from hold due to several positive internal developments.</p>
<p>-- sees initiation of share repurchase program as positive development.</p>
<p>-- sets 12-month target price of $95 a share.</p>
<p>-- said 1997 earnings estimate of $3.35 a sahre should be viewed as a conservation number.</p>
<p>-- Georgia-Pacific gained 1/4 to 74-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
